 "safe_design_checklist": {
  "1_pins": "PASS (parent): every input port lands in its face / entry region (pin register in fdn / fup, or the landing ring at the pin for fn / frs entries); every output leaves from a face-region flop (fdn / fup merge or pin register, or a landing read register; pass-through wires only inside the face leaves). rst_n -> lp reset runs (depth 10) -> each leaf's own 2-stage landing. OPEN: the 182 slice<->slice face landings (plan claude/qw-slice4-face-1019 @7811217d7) are NOT in this parent yet (QW-SLICE6 follow-up).",
  "2_reach": "OPEN / measured by the gate: cross-region nets are landings (E=4: <= ~2.6 mm per landing window); the face<->face pass crossings (fdn <-> fup 2.2 mm: chu_q, hr, cmd, chd, treq, l9) and the N<->S corridor (rs_n, cw_s 2.2 mm) are the long ones; 1-bit reset runs hop <= 405 um (lp reach)",
  "3_fanout": "PASS by construction: one read half per (net, reader region), shared write rings (share_rings); leaf internal fanout is the leaf kits' gates (sibling lanes)",
  "4_depth": "PASS (parent): wires only between children; landing read = registered slot select",
  "5_storage": "PASS: VM / CROM / PROG / BTAB in 22 SRAM macros (suvm 18, btab 4), tload tables in 4 ROM macros; landing rings D=8 are fixed-latency landings (192620 flops)",
  "6_floorplan": "PASS (plan): hard children on the 43.2 lattice (8 stnrgc, 8 lane heads safe2, 24 SFU; 32 x leaves soft stand-in), SRAM / ROM on the macro lattice with >= 20-um channels; one full-width std-cell band per region between the child rows; outline = the die slot 2462.376 x 2591.976 (aspect 1.05); parent pins <= 4.54/um per port group",
  "7_clock": "multiple_cts_roots: 19 regional roots (ck_r_*), entry on the nearest face beside the region's register mass; fences hold every soft leaf + its landing read halves beside its entry (stnent gate3 lesson); judged per region at child flops (TT / FF spread <= 80); io_hold_margin 0.03",
  "8_schedule": "static; compiler record results/arch/qw_slice6_1019/lp/qfd_dv_s5b_lp_record.json: every cross-region reader pin +5 edges (lp lag_pins; slice loops ctl <-> SU / station / scalar, fdn <-> fup: the compiler re-schedules); leaf HARD registers +1 (ctl bundles / VM writes / own word / ag, stm tw, suvm su_nr, fdn pc_bad, tap cid); THRU stream / scalar chains +6 a hop vs the plan's FWD +3 (stand-in stream); NOTICE lanes/QW-GEN3.md",
  "stand_ins": "LABELLED STAND-INS: stream + tload (qfd_dv_s5_stm: QW-STREAM2 t2/t2c and QW-TLOAD2 ns3/ns3b pending), x leaves = SOFT RTL stand-in (ot_qfd_xs_leaf at its defaults: the closed w130 view is a legacy M6 abstract that FAILs child_lint (c) under this one-level parent; M5 re-kit view owed); SOFT in this gate (kits gating in QW-SLICE6 sub-lanes, no views yet): suvm, ctl, sc, red, tap, xhead, lrly, btab, fdn / fup"
 },
